# Elemental Gearbolt (Unworked V2)

[No Gun Flash]
Type = Gameshark
Activation = EndFrame
Author = Bratwurstmensch
Description = For the Unworked V2 modification only. Removes the bright white gunshot flashes by reducing the flash overlay to a single pixel in height, without disabling the rendering call. Significantly reduces stuttering compared with the Nuvee approach. A very brief pause may still be visible when firing during camera movement.
